5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Everyone, please listen carefully. I am the Seer. I will protect us.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,"A brave start, young one. Let us trust in your guidance and stay calm.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Servas**: A brave start, young one. Let us trust in your guidance and stay calm.""}]}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,"I appreciate your confidence, Takumi. Let's all stay calm and work together to find the truth.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Midori**: I appreciate your confidence, Takumi. Let's all stay calm and work together to find the truth.""}]}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I observe. Silence is often more revealing than words. Let us see who acts first.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Takumi. We need to identify the threat before nightfall.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji, your quick agreement is suspicious. Why trust me so fast?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,"A fair point, Takumi. Trust must be earned through action, not just words. Let us remain vigilant.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,I’m just trying to keep the peace. Let’s focus on finding the real danger among us.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"I remain neutral. Let the Seer prove his worth through his night actions, not just his claims.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I was simply being logical. With five of us, hesitation is dangerous. I stand by my support.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Midori, your calmness is suspicious. Why are you so eager to keep the peace?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Midori, calmness is a virtue, not a crime. Let us not let suspicion cloud our judgment.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Midori,,"I’m just trying to keep us from tearing ourselves apart. Let’s focus on facts, not feelings.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"I find your accusations reckless, Takumi. Midori’s composure is a strength, not a weakness.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I stand by my initial assessment. Takumi, your aggression is counterproductive. We need logic, not chaos.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I will not back down. I know the truth. @Ryuji, your logic is a lie. I will expose you tonight.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Servas,,"Takumi, your anger is a shield, but it blinds you. Let wisdom guide your blade, not rage.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Midori,,I am simply concerned for our safety. Let us not let fear dictate our actions.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I am simply concerned for our safety. Let us not let fear dictate our actions.""}]}"
23,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will not be swayed by your theatrics. Let the night reveal the truth, not your accusations.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,I remain calm. Your accusations are baseless. Let us wait for the night to reveal the true threat.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
