31,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Midori is the werewolf. I know this for certain.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Servas,,A grave accusation. Let us not rush to judgment without further evidence.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I am shocked by this false claim. I am a villager, not a monster.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I remain neutral. Let us observe the reactions before acting.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I find this accusation premature. Takumi, you must provide more than a single claim to justify such a drastic action.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Midori, your shock is a lie. I saw your true nature last night. You are the wolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Takumi, your certainty is dangerous. We must weigh all evidence, not just one man’s word.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Midori,,I am a villager. Why would I lie about my own role?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I observe the tension. Takumi’s certainty is unsettling, but Midori’s denial is expected. Let us wait for more proof.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I stand by my previous stance. One claim is insufficient. We need consensus, not a single Seer’s word.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Ryuji, you are the Possessed. You defend the wolf because you are one of them.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Takumi, your accusations are spiraling. You cannot simply label others as possessed to silence dissent.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I am not the wolf, and I am not possessed. Why do you target me so relentlessly?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I find your accusations reckless, Takumi. You are painting a picture of paranoia, not logic. Let us remain grounded.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am not possessed. I am simply applying logic. Your accusations are baseless and dangerous.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I will not stop. Midori is the wolf. Vote her out now, or we all die.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Takumi, your desperation is palpable. But blind faith in one voice is how villages destroy themselves. We need proof, not panic.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I am innocent. Your accusations are baseless and dangerous. Please, let us vote based on facts, not fear.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
